i.github.com/users/yusong-yan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2024-12-31T00:09:21Z","updated_at":"2025-03-13T18:08:18Z","closed_at":"2025-03-01T01:08:37Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-14702](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-14702)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nXClusterTestWaitForReplicationDrain.TestConsumerPollFailureMetric in TSAN fails intermittently, about 2 out of every 10 times, due to a tablet being incorrectly marked as drained.\r\nHere is the error message:\r\n```\r\n../../src/yb/integration-tests/xcluster/xcluster-test.cc:2977\r\nFailed\r\nBad status: Illegal state (yb/integration-tests/xcluster/xcluster_test_base.cc:810): Mismatched number of non-drained streams. Expected 9, got 8\r\n\r\n```\r\nRoot cause:\r\nCurrently, source consider target is caught up when GetChanges responds with 0 records.\r\n```\r\nvoid CDCServiceImpl::UpdateTabletXClusterMetrics(\r\n  ...\r\n  if (records_size <= 0) {\r\n    ...\r\n    tablet_metric->last_caughtup_physicaltime->set_value(GetCurrentTimeMicros());\r\n```\r\nHowever, In scenarios where the majority replicated op ID has advanced but the last committed op ID has not, GetChanges responds with 0 records. However, this does not indicate that the target is fully caught up, as more records remain to be read.\r\n\r\n### Issue Type\r\n\r\nkind/bug\r\n\r\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\r\n\r\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\r\n\r\n[DB-14702]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-14702?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/25457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/25457/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}